WEBVTT

00:03.210 --> 00:06.000
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:03.210 --> 00:06.040
Tachibana-san, you're a pop idol, right?

00:06.040 --> 00:07.420
I think I've seen you on TV...

00:07.420 --> 00:11.000
I'm a model, sir.
I just got back from filming overseas.

00:11.250 --> 00:13.630
Oh, my apologies.

00:14.710 --> 00:17.920
I still can't believe a famous model like
yourself would come to our school.

00:20.500 --> 00:22.250
It's a good school, sir.

00:22.630 --> 00:23.580
Super old, though.

00:23.580 --> 00:24.210
Huh?

00:26.960 --> 00:29.880
I hate you and I hate manga!

00:38.040 --> 00:40.920
And I spotted the guy I hate.

02:11.000 --> 02:15.960
<b>Cosplay Group Potential?</b>

02:16.000 --> 02:17.330
M-Mikarin!

02:17.330 --> 02:20.580
Holy shit, it's Mikari Tachibana in the flesh!

02:20.580 --> 02:21.500
Her legs are so long!

02:21.500 --> 02:22.710
And she's so cute!

02:22.710 --> 02:25.000
Like, inhumanly cute, honestly.

02:25.380 --> 02:28.210
M-Mikarin, could I get your autograph?

02:28.210 --> 02:30.000
Dude, what's wrong with you?!

02:30.290 --> 02:32.920
Of course! Anyone else want one?

02:32.920 --> 02:33.790
Wait, really?!

02:32.920 --> 02:33.790
I do!

02:33.790 --> 02:34.630
Me too!

02:35.330 --> 02:36.830
She's so nice.

02:36.830 --> 02:38.710
Bet she's 'nice' to everyone.

02:39.210 --> 02:41.920
Heard she's dating that male model Kei-kun.

02:41.920 --> 02:43.130
Lucky her.

02:43.500 --> 02:47.920
Not surprised. With her looks and body,
she could have any guy she wanted.

02:48.250 --> 02:50.830
Hey, do you guys have a manga club?

02:50.830 --> 02:52.710
A manga club? Anyone know?

02:52.710 --> 02:55.710
Wait, you like manga? Me too!

02:55.710 --> 02:58.330
Nope, I hate manga.

03:05.580 --> 03:06.960
It was an act of God.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.330
Just an accident.

03:10.880 --> 03:15.130
Calm down, just act like it never happened.

03:15.290 --> 03:15.830
<b>Manga Club</b>

03:16.460 --> 03:18.540
I hope she's not here already...

03:18.540 --> 03:20.540
Oh, Senpai!

03:20.880 --> 03:22.710
Um, uh...

03:23.170 --> 03:24.540
This is so awkward...

03:24.960 --> 03:26.630
I gotta break the silence!

03:31.210 --> 03:33.210
My heart's still racing...

03:33.670 --> 03:35.670
Am I still sick?

03:39.460 --> 03:43.540
Hey, uh, sounded like something
big went down this morning.

03:43.790 --> 03:47.420
Oh, yeah, a new student joined our class.

03:47.420 --> 03:49.670
She's some famous model.

03:50.130 --> 03:52.330
A model? Huh.

03:53.170 --> 03:55.710
Yeah, she's a model.

03:56.500 --> 03:59.210
A-and she's really cute!

03:59.210 --> 04:02.170
Wow, didn't think you cared about that kinda stuff.

04:03.460 --> 04:08.880
She's got the perfect looks and body to
cosplay as Lilie's best friend, Miriella!

04:09.250 --> 04:11.540
Oh. That's what you cared about.

04:11.540 --> 04:15.420
I could make a legendary ROM if I got her to join me!

04:16.170 --> 04:17.290
Oh, right!

04:17.830 --> 04:19.880
I found this in here!

04:20.670 --> 04:22.790
Yeah, that belongs to the club.

04:22.790 --> 04:25.420
I remember my senpai taking pictures with it.

04:25.420 --> 04:27.080
Apparently, it's a good model!

04:27.580 --> 04:28.500
It turned on!

04:28.500 --> 04:30.290
There are still pictures on it.

04:30.290 --> 04:32.250
These must be from the Culture Festival.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.790
Didn't know he was snapping pics here.

04:39.290 --> 04:40.630
I-I'm sorry!

04:40.630 --> 04:41.880
Huh? For what?

04:42.420 --> 04:45.420
I keep making all these demands of you.

04:46.130 --> 04:48.330
What do you want to do, Senpai?

04:49.290 --> 04:52.000
I'm ready for anything!

04:52.630 --> 04:55.330
What'll it be today? Anime? Video games?

04:55.330 --> 04:57.790
Club's all about having fun together!

05:01.670 --> 05:02.500
Nah...

05:03.170 --> 05:04.420
Let's take some pictures.

05:05.210 --> 05:12.790
Last time was my first time taking cosplay pictures,
but it was kinda fun, I guess.

05:13.210 --> 05:15.670
And you looked really...

05:16.000 --> 05:17.830
Your cosplay looked really good.

05:19.540 --> 05:20.540
Hello?!

05:20.540 --> 05:22.210
I'm just so happy!

05:22.920 --> 05:24.000
So those are happy tears?!

05:24.250 --> 05:27.750
I thought I was forcing you to
go along with all my silly ideas...

05:28.210 --> 05:30.420
I was so worried you didn't want to do any of it...

05:30.420 --> 05:32.290
I wouldn't do it if I didn't want to...

05:32.290 --> 05:35.210
So hearing you want to do it makes me super happy!

05:35.880 --> 05:36.670
Huh?

05:38.670 --> 05:39.830
I'm gonna get changed!

05:39.830 --> 05:41.040
Hold it!

05:42.790 --> 05:47.500
Teachers were inspecting bags today so
I didn't bring my cosplay.

05:47.500 --> 05:49.250
Wow, too bad.

05:49.670 --> 05:51.790
We can take pictures another time.

05:52.080 --> 05:53.080
Wait!

05:53.250 --> 05:55.080
Senpai, come with me!

05:55.080 --> 05:55.790
Huh?!

06:01.710 --> 06:04.380
Okay, why this random classroom?

06:04.380 --> 06:06.790
Cause no one's gonna come in here!

06:07.250 --> 06:09.380
Let's take some practice shots in here!

06:09.670 --> 06:12.670
You mean, like, just in your uniform?

06:12.670 --> 06:13.210
Yep!

06:13.210 --> 06:16.540
And this 50 mm fixed
lens should work for us.

06:16.790 --> 06:19.420
We'll just leave it in P-mode for now.

06:19.420 --> 06:21.630
What am I getting all worked up for?

06:21.630 --> 06:24.380
I'm just taking pictures of Ririsa.
She's not Liliel!

06:33.330 --> 06:34.670
How do I look?

06:34.670 --> 06:37.000
I dunno, but I took a bunch...

06:39.250 --> 06:40.580
W-well?

06:42.040 --> 06:43.500
That bad?!

06:43.500 --> 06:44.750
I look horrible...

06:45.460 --> 06:48.080
Oh, sorry! The pictures are fine.

06:48.630 --> 06:53.330
I know we have to practice,
but I just hate seeing pictures of myself...

06:55.540 --> 06:56.630
They look fine, though.

06:57.880 --> 07:01.380
Cause I'm not Liliel,
and I wish I could be her.

07:01.830 --> 07:02.920
Sorry.

07:02.920 --> 07:05.920
I know you wish I were 2D, too.

07:07.040 --> 07:11.670
I mean, school uniforms are all over the place in manga.
This is 2D enough.

07:11.960 --> 07:13.330
You're so smart, Senpai!

07:13.330 --> 07:14.710
Wait, I am?

07:14.710 --> 07:18.670
I see it now!
I just need to pretend this uniform is cosplay!

07:18.670 --> 07:19.460
What?

07:19.460 --> 07:21.500
This is gonna be perfect!

07:22.420 --> 07:23.630
Manga-length skirt!

07:24.580 --> 07:26.250
Glasses, off!

07:27.170 --> 07:28.380
A touch of makeup!

07:32.210 --> 07:34.500
H-how about now?

07:35.040 --> 07:37.500
Do I look like a manga character now?

07:42.040 --> 07:46.380
T-this is Ririsa, remember?!
She's not Liliel!

07:47.170 --> 07:52.670
She's 3D, she's 3D, she's 3D...

07:52.670 --> 07:54.580
Is that helping him focus?

07:56.080 --> 07:58.250
But this pose is too normal.

07:58.540 --> 08:00.710
I should go for a sexy manga pose instead.

08:07.460 --> 08:11.790
Whoa! No, her underwear's part of her costume!
It's totally normal!

08:12.080 --> 08:13.130
Is it, though?!

08:13.750 --> 08:15.290
Not good enough...

08:16.000 --> 08:19.420
The ecchi manga I like gets sexier than this!

08:20.250 --> 08:22.080
I gotta live up to its standards!

08:28.710 --> 08:30.420
Where'd my glasses go?

08:30.420 --> 08:32.290
The clumsy glasses girl!

08:32.290 --> 08:35.000
That's definitely a manga cliché!

08:35.330 --> 08:36.380
Next up...

08:36.380 --> 08:37.290
Owie!

08:37.290 --> 08:38.380
Maybe it wasn't acting.

08:40.830 --> 08:41.830
Whoa!

08:47.880 --> 08:49.580
Sorry! I didn't mean to!

08:49.580 --> 08:50.670
This is perfect, Senpai!

08:50.670 --> 08:51.460
What?

08:51.460 --> 08:54.830
This is the kind of fanservice
I see all the time in shonen manga!

08:55.500 --> 08:59.580
She's actually getting this excited
about acting out a sexy scene.

08:59.960 --> 09:01.670
This is what Ririsa likes.

09:02.040 --> 09:05.080
Cosplay is insane...

09:05.880 --> 09:07.500
Senpai!

09:08.670 --> 09:11.330
Let's take a look at those pictures now!

09:11.330 --> 09:12.170
Sure.

09:12.420 --> 09:15.830
They all came out pretty sexy,
just like you wanted.

09:20.040 --> 09:23.710
I forgot I wasn't wearing a cosplay!

09:24.290 --> 09:25.460
Don't look!

09:25.460 --> 09:27.000
W-why?!

09:27.330 --> 09:30.080
These aren't costume panties,
they're my actual panties!

09:30.080 --> 09:31.580
No looking, you perv!

09:31.580 --> 09:32.670
What?!

09:32.670 --> 09:35.960
We got our practice,
so make sure you erase all those pictures!

09:35.960 --> 09:37.380
Okay, sheesh!

09:39.750 --> 09:44.580
Class 1-1, Ririsa Amano,
please come to the faculty office immediately.

09:44.580 --> 09:46.330
Think that's for you?

09:47.460 --> 09:49.920
I totally forgot I had mandatory tutoring!

09:49.920 --> 09:50.420
I'm gonna be in so much trouble!

09:50.420 --> 09:51.750
Her grades are already that bad?

09:50.420 --> 09:51.750
I'm gonna be in so much trouble!

09:51.750 --> 09:52.710
Her grades are already that bad?

09:58.420 --> 10:00.210
Sorry, Ririsa.

10:00.380 --> 10:03.250
<b>DELETE PHOTO?</b>

10:00.750 --> 10:02.750
Club's all about having fun together!

10:03.960 --> 10:07.540
But I've gotta keep pictures of fun club activities.

10:09.130 --> 10:11.170
What's Mikarin doing in the club building?!

10:11.170 --> 10:12.830
Is she gonna join a club?!
Which one?

10:12.830 --> 10:13.830
Can I get a picture?

10:13.830 --> 10:16.080
Sorry, no pictures!

10:16.080 --> 10:17.710
Hey, I just said no pictures...

10:20.380 --> 10:22.210
Excuse me, I need to get through!

10:22.420 --> 10:25.630
Sorry, let me through!
Please stop pushing!

10:25.630 --> 10:27.670
Move, please!
I need to get through here!

10:28.920 --> 10:30.540
Out of the way!

10:38.170 --> 10:39.670
I'm sorry! Are you okay?!

10:40.630 --> 10:42.000
I'm so sorry!

10:42.000 --> 10:43.500
Wait up, Mikarin!

10:49.460 --> 10:51.830
Hanging out alone in here's just not as fun.

10:52.630 --> 10:55.250
How'd I have so much fun in here by myself before?

10:55.500 --> 10:57.130
Mikarin!

10:58.210 --> 10:59.420
What the...

11:02.460 --> 11:03.630
<b>Manga Club</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:08.670
Manga...

11:12.420 --> 11:13.290
Senpai?!

11:15.960 --> 11:17.330
Wait, Mikari?

11:25.500 --> 11:26.540
S...

11:29.500 --> 11:30.580
Senpai!

11:46.790 --> 11:48.330
I found you.

11:49.920 --> 11:52.750
<b>5 years earlier</b>

11:52.080 --> 11:53.670
Okumura-senpai!

11:55.080 --> 12:00.250
Senpai, do you have a crush on anyone?

12:00.750 --> 12:01.880
I sure do!

12:02.960 --> 12:07.130
I'm in love with Liliel!
She'll never betray me, not ever!

12:10.750 --> 12:16.750
You stupid, weird otaku!
I hate you and I hate manga!

12:21.920 --> 12:23.500
It's been too long.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.630
Mikarin!

12:25.880 --> 12:27.290
I thought she came this way!

12:27.420 --> 12:28.170
Mikarin?

12:28.380 --> 12:29.580
Mikarin!?

12:29.580 --> 12:31.630
I don't see her anywhere, though.

12:33.920 --> 12:36.210
Did you hear something?

12:33.920 --> 12:36.210
W-what's going on?

12:36.210 --> 12:39.290
I haven't seen you since we went
to different middle schools.

12:41.710 --> 12:43.170
Mikarin!

12:43.170 --> 12:44.960
Did she go home?

12:45.880 --> 12:47.080
This is crazy.

12:47.080 --> 12:49.750
I can't believe you're the famous
model who just started today.

12:49.750 --> 12:51.710
Please, I'm not that famous.

12:51.710 --> 12:53.960
Thanks for rescuing me, though, Senpai.

12:54.080 --> 12:56.170
There's one thing I still don't get.

12:56.170 --> 12:58.250
Why'd you hug me all of the sudden?

12:58.250 --> 12:59.920
Sorry, I couldn't help it.

13:00.750 --> 13:04.630
I was kinda hoping I'd make your heart skip a beat.

13:04.750 --> 13:05.670
What?!

13:07.920 --> 13:10.330
Wait, why are you soaking wet?

13:10.330 --> 13:14.790
It's a long story.
Can I stay here till my clothes dry off?

13:15.080 --> 13:16.830
Yeah, sure.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.580
Even my bra is all wet.

13:26.830 --> 13:30.710
This is the super cute one I wore just for you, too.

13:30.710 --> 13:32.630
Wh- you can't be serious!

13:33.330 --> 13:34.670
Sure you don't wanna see it?

13:34.670 --> 13:37.500
S-stop messing around and
put your stupid underwear on!

13:41.040 --> 13:43.250
Okay, I'm good.
You can turn around now.

13:46.460 --> 13:48.630
Whoops, maybe I wasn't good.

13:49.670 --> 13:51.330
W-would you stop messing with me?!

13:53.670 --> 13:56.540
What? It's not like I have a change of clothes.

13:57.380 --> 14:00.960
I'm still tired from my late-night shoot yesterday,
so I'll take a nap while I wait.

14:00.960 --> 14:03.830
Okay, fine, but put some clothes on.

14:06.210 --> 14:09.290
Wanna join me?

14:11.380 --> 14:13.580
Okay, that's enough!
Why are you doing this?!

14:13.580 --> 14:17.330
Cause you never treated me like
a cute girl when I was a kid,

14:17.330 --> 14:19.830
and teasing you is really fun.

14:21.380 --> 14:23.460
Bet you think I'm cute now, huh?

14:23.460 --> 14:27.170
I dunno. You've always been cute, Mikari.

14:27.170 --> 14:27.750
Huh?!

14:30.960 --> 14:32.540
Wait, really?!

14:33.170 --> 14:34.040
Yeah?

14:34.330 --> 14:36.500
Everyone said she was cute back then, too.

14:36.880 --> 14:39.460
Not like that! I'm different now!

14:41.080 --> 14:46.000
I got way cuter, and way more fashionable,
and now I'm a famous model!

14:47.460 --> 14:50.750
I'm not a little kid anymore!

14:55.080 --> 14:57.540
The way you're fiddling with your pigtails...

14:58.420 --> 15:03.210
You're not that different.
You're still the little kid I played with back then.

15:04.880 --> 15:05.920
I am not!

15:05.920 --> 15:07.420
You're naked, you're naked!

15:29.960 --> 15:31.130
S-sorry!

15:29.960 --> 15:31.130
Wait!

15:32.580 --> 15:34.580
Don't go, Senpai.

15:35.330 --> 15:38.540
I've been waiting forever to have you this close.

15:40.420 --> 15:41.710
That took forever!

15:41.710 --> 15:43.580
I hope Senpai is still here.

15:44.500 --> 15:48.290
Can we stay like this just a little longer?

15:53.130 --> 15:57.880
There's no way he doesn't get tempted now...

15:59.630 --> 16:04.040
Wait, Senpai! I'm not... I'm not ready to go that far!

16:01.670 --> 16:02.710
<b>You wanna do
it at school?!</b>

16:06.790 --> 16:08.000
You're gonna catch a cold like that.

16:10.210 --> 16:14.080
I stepped right on this doujin, too...
Forgive me, Liliel.

16:20.790 --> 16:22.000
He's a lost cause.

16:26.250 --> 16:27.670
Hey, Senpai.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.750
Do you have a crush on anyone?

16:31.130 --> 16:32.540
Like, a girl?

16:34.130 --> 16:35.080
Senpai?

16:38.330 --> 16:39.290
Yeah.

16:41.380 --> 16:44.750
I'm in love with Liliel, of course!
And I'll never cheat on her!

16:45.500 --> 16:50.130
Ririsa's face popped into my head,
but that's only because I thought of her Liliel cosplay!

16:50.460 --> 16:53.670
Which means everything is fine!
Nothing is wrong!

16:53.670 --> 16:55.170
Weirdo otaku.

16:55.790 --> 16:58.130
You haven't changed at all.

17:03.670 --> 17:06.210
I'm happy to see you, but I still hate you.

17:06.210 --> 17:07.080
What...

17:12.580 --> 17:15.130
Why was Mikari crying?

17:19.330 --> 17:21.920
Why can't I just tell him I like him?

17:22.790 --> 17:25.330
My life would be so much easier if I hated him.

17:25.330 --> 17:30.750
I should've known he wouldn't change his
mind when he found out I was a supermodel.

17:31.170 --> 17:32.750
You interested in showbiz?

17:33.580 --> 17:38.000
A girl with your figure could kill it as a model.
You could be the cutest one out there.

17:39.170 --> 17:41.790
If I got cuter, and got popular...

17:44.580 --> 17:47.000
Great! You're looking hot!

17:44.580 --> 17:47.000
Then maybe Senpai will like me!

17:47.670 --> 17:49.080
Perfect!

17:52.710 --> 17:56.790
Mikari-chan, I heard you've got
a crush on a boy at your school?

17:56.790 --> 17:58.580
Huh? Yeah.

17:59.170 --> 18:01.290
But, he doesn't feel the same way.

18:01.290 --> 18:02.580
Uh-huh.

18:02.580 --> 18:04.380
He's just some random student, though.

18:04.790 --> 18:08.710
I mean, yeah.
And he's a weird, creepy otaku, too.

18:08.710 --> 18:10.500
So why him?

18:11.000 --> 18:14.210
When you get famous,
you could be with an actor or a famous singer.

18:14.210 --> 18:16.130
Forget about him.

18:17.000 --> 18:19.040
Forget about him?

18:21.500 --> 18:23.670
Look at the wild caveman!

18:23.670 --> 18:25.420
Stop it!

18:23.670 --> 18:25.420
So much hair!

18:25.420 --> 18:26.130
So much hair!

18:26.130 --> 18:27.630
It's so weird and fluffy!

18:28.710 --> 18:29.750
Stop it!

18:34.080 --> 18:37.540
Lord Ashford commands you!
Get your hands off my Liliel!

18:41.710 --> 18:43.580
Eww, it's Yuckymura!

18:43.580 --> 18:45.670
Run! You'll catch his nerd cooties!

18:54.500 --> 18:56.710
It's Liliel! She's from this manga!

19:02.420 --> 19:07.380
<b>Children's Park</b>

19:03.960 --> 19:05.250
Wanna play?

19:05.250 --> 19:07.000
Why? Who are you, even?

19:07.630 --> 19:09.460
C'mon, lemme play.

19:09.460 --> 19:10.330
No way!

19:11.250 --> 19:12.630
Lord Ashford commands you!

19:13.210 --> 19:14.880
I know that manga!

19:26.710 --> 19:28.210
You from around here?

19:28.210 --> 19:29.460
You're cute.

19:31.540 --> 19:32.670
Run, Liliel!

19:33.420 --> 19:35.380
Yes, Ashford-sama!

19:36.170 --> 19:37.580
Oh, no!

19:36.170 --> 19:37.580
Yuckymura!

19:41.920 --> 19:47.710
Everyone falls in love with me the second they see me,
but not Senpai.

19:48.130 --> 19:50.630
He hasn't changed since the day I fell in love with him.

19:52.040 --> 19:55.790
I could've forgotten about him if he'd changed, but...

19:57.920 --> 19:58.880
Mikari-chan?

20:00.750 --> 20:01.630
No.

20:02.080 --> 20:05.920
If I betrayed him now,
I'd be no better than the 3D girls he hates.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.170
Huh? 3D what?

20:08.960 --> 20:13.250
He's been betrayed over and over again.

20:13.750 --> 20:15.920
That's why he's so devoted to Liliel.

20:18.330 --> 20:22.630
So I'm never going to betray him!

20:23.750 --> 20:28.960
If he only trusts an angel,
then I'll become that angel for him.

20:29.790 --> 20:32.710
I'll work hard so that one day,

20:32.710 --> 20:35.040
he turns towards me and finally
says the words I want to hear...

20:35.580 --> 20:38.080
One day... One day...

20:42.290 --> 20:46.630
I haven't seen him in years,
but I'm still head over heels.

20:47.580 --> 20:50.880
I guess I'm a little relieved he hasn't changed.

20:51.750 --> 20:56.500
He's still the guy I love,
and no one's gonna take him from me.

20:56.790 --> 21:00.750
How am I gonna get through
to that stubborn otaku, though?

21:02.170 --> 21:06.290
Oh, Senpai! I can see him from here! Nice!

21:07.460 --> 21:08.960
Who's SHE?!

21:09.630 --> 21:11.500
I'm so sorry about this!

21:11.710 --> 21:16.000
Don't apologize, your timing was kinda perf...
I mean, don't worry about it!

21:16.540 --> 21:17.920
Is everything okay?

21:17.920 --> 21:19.830
Yeah, everything's fine.

21:19.830 --> 21:22.000
Then let's get back to taking pictures!

21:22.170 --> 21:25.250
Can you stop randomly stripping?!
And I thought you didn't have your cosplay!

21:25.250 --> 21:27.380
I remembered I brought a spare
costume to school, just in case!

21:27.380 --> 21:29.210
In case what?!
Why would you ever need it?!

21:30.540 --> 21:34.000
My makeup's not perfect,
but it'll work for some test shots.

21:34.000 --> 21:36.580
Yeah, it doesn't have to be perfect.

21:37.380 --> 21:38.500
Senpai?

21:47.880 --> 21:48.920
Se...

21:50.830 --> 21:54.540
Senpai, you liar!
You said you wouldn't cheat on Liliel!

21:54.540 --> 21:55.540
So what's this?!

21:55.540 --> 21:57.540
And why are you blushing
like that in front of her?!

21:57.540 --> 21:58.580
Wait, hold on...

21:58.830 --> 22:01.420
Senpai, do you know her?

22:01.420 --> 22:02.670
You stay out of this!

22:02.670 --> 22:05.830
You're in my class though, right, Tachibana-san?

22:08.250 --> 22:11.290
Will you cosplay with me?!

22:12.250 --> 22:13.130
What?

22:23.670 --> 22:25.130
Are you Liliel?

23:56.000 --> 24:01.000
<b>Lili x Miri</b>
